Z||000000||GodSend||08-17-2000||03:02 PM||||  Im a proud new Owner, So expect to see me around here alot.  I used to own a 1991 Eagle Talon TSI, but I recently traded it in and bought a 1987 Fiero GT.<P>  The car is bone stock (performance wise).  It has 5 star rims with 235/50/16's perellies on the rear and 205/50/16's on the front.  The car has a 14 Layer "Candy Brandy Wine" paint job , with 96,000 orig. km's (60,000 miles).  <P>  The interior is leather/suade.  I love it, drives great, lots of zip.  Welcome me to the family.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>GodSend<P>(ill be posting a website w/ pics soon)||||reg||14
