Z||000002||tgowens||08-17-2000||03:06 PM||||well GodSend, welcome to the family!! And - welcome to the forum, you are sure to like it here -- lot's of fun, lots, or advice, lots of solutions, lots of problems, lots of opinions............and lots of people. You can generally find someone here who has had a similar problem as one you may have and has an answer to a question - there is a lot of Fiero experience here as well.<P>And, good choice on the '87GT - that's what I drive!!<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/Terry_sig.gif">                 <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
