Z||000010||My7Fieros||08-18-2000||12:22 AM||||Welcome to the forum dude, and congrats on the new car.<BR>88Formula, I suspect one of the reasons he got rid of the talon and got a fiero is because thats what he wanted. Not everyone is interested in strictly quarter miles and how fast a car will generally go. I like the Fiero for lots of reasons, and not a one of them is how fast it will do the 1/4 mile in...I dont live on the Indianapolis 500 speedway.||||reg||1
