Z||000012||GodSend||08-18-2000||11:18 AM||||3 Simple Reasons I sold the TSI<P>1]  Broken Turbo + Exhaust Housing<P>2]  280,000 kms<P>3] Recent Work on the car =<P>Timing Belt/ Wp/ Tensioner (1000$)<BR>Clutch (1800$)<BR>Brakes All Around (1000$)<BR>Tired (600$)<BR>OilPan (400$)<P>Basically it was bleeding me dry.  Then the car got broken into an all my stereo got stolen.  Luckly with all my recipts and pictures I was able to get the entire 6500 back from insurance.  Once I sold the Talon for 2500 I had a good amount to use towards adifferent car that wasent going to cost me my tuition to keep running.<P>Once you see her, you will understand why  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
